{"parse": {"title": "TRC-15", "pageid": 6369, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TRC-14\" title=\"TRC-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TRC-15</span><a href=\"/wiki/TRC-16\" title=\"TRC-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TRC</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">15</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.80.89.E6.8B.A9.E9.A2.98\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"选择题\">选择题</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 选择题</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Puppy's Choice</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>十<span class=\"color-value\"></span>字<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>口<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>三<span class=\"color-value\"></span>岔<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>口<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>又<span class=\"color-value\"></span>或<span class=\"color-value\"></span>者<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>硬<span class=\"color-value\"></span>币<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>正<span class=\"color-value\"></span>反<span class=\"color-value\"></span>面<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1110115</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhantingnei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhantingnei\"><img alt=\"zhantingnei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/600px-Cg-zhantingnei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/900px-Cg-zhantingnei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/Cg-zhantingnei.png/1200px-Cg-zhantingnei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪……汪……<i>&lt;遥控器……奖杯……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪！汪汪。<i>&lt;奖杯上面还有气味！……她是神秘学家，并且也在这附近。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他把奖杯放在了查尔顿的身边，近乎逃离地向更僻静处跑去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-502301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-502301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-502301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">路人：</div><div>嘿！那只小狗跑了，它打算做什么？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-zhantingneibu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"zhantingneibu1\"><img alt=\"zhantingneibu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-zhantingneibu1.png/600px-Cg-zhantingneibu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-zhantingneibu1.png/900px-Cg-zhantingneibu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-zhantingneibu1.png/1200px-Cg-zhantingneibu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾西：</div><div>咳咳咳……难受，恶心，想哭。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>抱……抱歉，艾西老师。是我一下子让你吃了太多的怪东西……呃，甚至包括了我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>我发誓，等事情结束以后，我一定会带你去专业的皮包保养店好好护理一次！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>但现在，我们得尽快离开这儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾西：</div><div>完成了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>当然，艾弗森的表情像是刚吞下了一整只鼻涕史莱姆，他最终输给了神秘学家们的想象力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>那些意外出现的记者朋友们想必不会错过这个大新闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>现在里面乱成一团……而我们，将在这时候轻松离开——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>无人发觉～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c1/HeadIconSmall-306301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>嗯……是什么来了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾西：</div><div>同类。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>竟然有人找到了我，是我的行迹泄露了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>吽吽，吽……<i>&lt;无意冒犯，女士，您似乎拿错了东西……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>嘘……等等，等等！不要乱吠，别把其他人吸引过来了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪，汪汪！<i>&lt;我得叫醒查尔顿，并且尽快离开……在这里陷入更难以解释的状况之前。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>皮克勒斯放低了声音，但仍然在倾诉着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"612101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"612101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-612101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-612101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">艾西：</div><div>急迫，却无敌意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>好吧，小狗，谈谈你的条件吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗希望摆脱目前的处境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>你想离开这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>尽管不在计划之内，但我确实可以捎你一程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>汪汪……？<i>&lt;离开？我没打算……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>嗯……<i>&lt;至少不是现在……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-615901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">\"Doggie\"：</div><div>小狗寻求着你的帮助。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>你想要什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>这个，一瞬消失的“隐形颜料”，它能让你避开所有人的耳目，当然也能骗过小狗们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>或是这个，“微风滑臂”。当你展开双臂……咳，展开前腿时，只需要一点儿微风，鼓动的覆膜能让你去往任何地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>狺狺，狺。<i>&lt;它们听上去与我的理想无比契合，像是量身定做。&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>呜……<i>&lt;但……&gt;</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>还是说，你也打算让这儿的人都吓一大跳？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>一个“震荡闹钟”，能赶走附近所有的瞌睡虫，让所有人都无比清醒。咳，它一般用于应对那些昏昏欲睡的安保员们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>越发靠近的脚步声打断了他们的“交流”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">路人：</div><div>那只小狗呢？它刚才好像往这边来了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-502301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-502301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/01/HeadIconSmall-502301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">路人：</div><div>一只找到奖杯的小狗！这绝对是个大新闻，所有人都该围着它团团转！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>情况不对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>你得尽快做出选择了，敏锐的小狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那些稀奇古怪的道具陈列在皮克勒斯的面前，这将是一个意义非凡的决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">梅兰妮：</div><div>再见，小狗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">皮克勒斯：</div><div>…………</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>刺耳的闹铃声回荡在展馆的各个角落。<br />查尔顿得以苏醒，而英雄小狗的故事终于得到了所有人的关注。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TRC-15"}}